{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31742","headline":"投张太祝 · 贾岛","name":"投张太祝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风骨高更老，向春初阳葩。\n[泠泠]月下韵，一一落海涯。\n有子不敢和，一听千叹嗟。\n身卧东北泥，魂挂西南霞。\n手把一枝栗，往轻觉程赊。\n水天朔方色，暖日嵩根花。\n达闲幽栖山，遣寻种药家。\n欲买双琼瑶，慙无一木瓜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}